Carafe: the swapchain that shows the screen can be taken off it when a window is drawn with GDI
(wine_nx_vk_displace_screen, patch 0106): its host swapchain is destroyed behind a gate that acquire and present
pass, and its next acquire or present returns VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_DATE_KHR, so the program makes a new swapchain,
which takes the screen back. Programs that wait for presents keep their swapchain. Host swapchains are counted
with wine_nx_vk_swapchain_made and wine_nx_vk_swapchain_gone.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

